sequenceDiagram
    participant STGCN as ST-GCN<br/>(Pose Pipeline)
    participant PC as PoseConsumer
    participant SHM as SHM Override<br/>(mp.Value)
    participant MQTT as MQTT Broker
    participant PROXY as Privacy Proxy
    participant TCP as TCP Stream<br/>(Recording)
    participant GO2RTC as go2rtc API
    participant LIVE as WebRTC/MSE<br/>Live View

    Note over STGCN: Fall detected!

    STGCN->>PC: Fall action triggered

    par Layer 1: SHM Override
        PC->>SHM: Set privacy_override_until
        Note over SHM: SHM stops substituting skeletons<br/>Birdseye/JSMPEG show real frames
    and Layers 2+3: MQTT Signal
        PC->>MQTT: Publish frigate/{cam}/privacy_override
        MQTT->>PROXY: Override message received
    end

    par Layer 2: Recording Override
        PROXY->>TCP: Flush pre-event buffer<br/>(10s of pre-fall footage)
        Note over TCP: Recording captures<br/>10s of pre-fall footage
        PROXY->>TCP: Switch to live real<br/>frame passthrough
        Note over TCP: Recording continues<br/>with real frames
    and Layer 3: Live View Override
        PROXY->>GO2RTC: PUT /api/streams<br/>iphone → iphone_real
        GO2RTC->>LIVE: WebRTC shows real camera
    end

    Note over PC: post_event_seconds later<br/>(default 60s)

    Note over PC: Override expires

    par Restore Privacy
        SHM-->>SHM: SHM resumes skeleton substitution
        PROXY-->>TCP: TCP stream resumes<br/>skeleton rendering
        PROXY->>GO2RTC: PUT /api/streams<br/>iphone → dead URL
        GO2RTC-->>LIVE: WebRTC fails → JSMPEG fallback<br/>→ SHM skeletons
    end
